# failure_case_propagate -- propagate a fallible call's status (README s9/s18), converging the ok/err arms to a single
# asserted `outcome` via the standard.test harness. The write succeeds, so the
# no-error arm runs and outcome = 0.
# Expected output (the fallible write prints its banner first):
#   attempting a fallible write
#   PASS  failure_case_propagate  (expected 0, actual 0)
#   ---- 1 passed, 0 failed ----

FailureCasePropagate is project
FailureCasePropagate module examplesFailureCasePropagate
FailureCasePropagate target console
FailureCasePropagate entry main

examplesFailureCasePropagate is module
examplesFailureCasePropagate path examples.failureCasePropagate
examplesFailureCasePropagate exports main
examplesFailureCasePropagate purpose "propagate a fallible call's status"
examplesFailureCasePropagate invariant "Self-checking via the test harness"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

ConsoleWriteError is error
ConsoleWriteError purpose "Represent failures from console output operations"


main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "propagate a fallible call's status and assert the converged outcome"
main invariant "Asserts the ok-arm outcome via the harness"
main let outcome mutable Int64 1
main let okMark immutable Int64 0
main let bannerText immutable String "attempting a fallible write"
main let harnessName immutable String "failure_case_propagate"
main let harnessExpected immutable Int64 0
main let noopDecoy immutable Int64 1
main let noopName immutable String "failure_case_propagate: real result (not the no-op 1)"
main do writeOk
main branch ifError writeOk goto afterCheck
main set outcome okMark
main at afterCheck do checkResult
main do noopCheck
main do harnessReport
main return harnessSummaryCode

writeOk is call
writeOk in main
writeOk invokes console.writeLine
writeOk arg text String bannerText
writeOk catch writeError ConsoleWriteError

checkResult is call
checkResult in main
checkResult invokes test.assertEqualInt64
checkResult arg name String harnessName
checkResult arg expected Int64 harnessExpected
checkResult arg actual Int64 outcome

noopCheck is call
noopCheck in main
noopCheck invokes test.assertNotEqualInt64
noopCheck arg name String noopName
noopCheck arg expected Int64 noopDecoy
noopCheck arg actual Int64 outcome

harnessReport is call
harnessReport in main
harnessReport invokes test.summary
harnessReport out harnessSummaryCode ExitCode
